{"id":107,"name":"الماعون","transliteration":"Al-Ma'un","translation":"The Small kindnesses","type":"meccan","total_verses":7,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يُكَذِّبُ بِٱلدِّينِ","emlaei":"أرأيت الذي يكذب بالدين","translation":"Have you seen the one who denies the Recompense","transliteration":"Araayta allathee yukaththibu bialddeeni"},{"id":2,"text":"فَذَٰلِكَ ٱلَّذِى يَدُعُّ ٱلْيَتِيمَ","emlaei":"فذلك الذي يدع اليتيم","translation":"For that is the one who drives away the orphan","transliteration":"Fathalika allathee yaduAAAAu alyateema"},{"id":3,"text":"وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلْمِسْكِينِ","emlaei":"ولا يحض على طعام المسكين","translation":"And does not encourage the feeding of the poor","transliteration":"Wala yahuddu AAala taAAami almiskeeni"},{"id":4,"text":"فَوَيْلٌ لِّلْمُصَلِّينَ","emlaei":"فويل للمصلين","translation":"So woe to those who pray","transliteration":"Fawaylun lilmusalleena"},{"id":5,"text":"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ عَن صَلَاتِهِمْ سَاهُونَ","emlaei":"الذين هم عن صلاتهم ساهون","translation":"[But] who are heedless of their prayer","transliteration":"Allatheena hum AAan salatihim sahoona"},{"id":6,"text":"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ يُرَآءُونَ","emlaei":"الذين هم يراءون","translation":"Those who make show [of their deeds]","transliteration":"Allatheena hum yuraoona"},{"id":7,"text":"وَيَمْنَعُونَ ٱلْمَاعُونَ","emlaei":"ويمنعون الماعون","translation":"And withhold [simple] assistance","transliteration":"WayamnaAAoona almaAAoona"}]}